    {
      "title": {
        "ja": "荒れる海",
        "en": "The Restless Sea"
      },
      "note": {
        "ja": "波は人間を飲み込みます。ここでは海が主役で、人は小さな出来事にすぎません。",
        "en": "The waves swallow people whole. Here the sea is the subject and the human is an incident."
      },
